<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>기초·심화 중국어 마스터 | 읽기·쓰기·발음·문화</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hanzi-writer@3.7.3/dist/hanzi-writer.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f6fb; --card: #ffffff; --text: #1e293b; --muted: #64748b; --border: #e2e8f0;
      --primary: #dc2626; --primary-soft: #fef2f2; --primary-hover: #b91c1c;
      --blue: #2563eb; --blue-soft: #eff6ff; --blue-hover: #1d4ed8;
      --green: #16a34a; --green-soft: #f0fdf4; --amber: #d97706; --amber-soft: #fffbeb;
      --red: #dc2626; --red-soft: #fef2f2;
      --shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 4px 10px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      --radius: 18px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.55; min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    .app-container { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 16px 44px; }
    .header { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .brand-badge {
      width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 14px; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #b91c1c); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25); flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .brand-title { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .brand-sub { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .progress-pill {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .progress-bar-wrap { width: 78px; height: 8px; background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }
    .progress-bar-fill { height: 100%; width: 0%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ef4444, #f97316); transition: width 0.3s ease; }

    /* Tabs */
    .tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 6px; background: #e2e8f0; padding: 5px; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    @media (min-width: 680px) { .tabs { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
    .tab-btn {
      border: none; background: transparent; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: #475569; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
    }
    .tab-btn.active { background: var(--card); color: var(--text); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
    .panel { display: none; }
    .panel.active { display: block; }

    /* Toolbar & Buttons */
    .toolbar {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
    }
    .toolbar-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1; }
    .select-control {
      padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: #f8fafc; color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; min-height: 40px; max-width: 100%;
    }
    .nav-buttons { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--card); color: var(--text); padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; min-height: 40px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.15s ease; user-select: none;
    }
    .btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #f8fafc; border-color: #cbd5e1; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); border-color: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--primary-hover); border-color: var(--primary-hover); }
    .btn-blue { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .btn-blue:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--blue-hover); border-color: var(--blue-hover); }
    .btn-blue-soft { background: var(--blue-soft); border-color: #bfdbfe; color: var(--blue); }
    .btn-blue-soft:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #dbeafe; }
    .btn-amber-soft { background: var(--amber-soft); border-color: #fde68a; color: var(--amber); }
    .btn-amber-soft:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #fef3c7; }
    .btn-sm { padding: 6px 11px; font-size: 0.82rem; min-height: 35px; border-radius: 9px; }
    .btn-speaking { animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35); }
      70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(37, 99, 235, 0); }
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }
    .study-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: stretch; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .study-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; } }
    .card-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .badge-category { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
    .badge-studied { background: var(--green-soft); color: var(--green); }
    .badge-lv-초급 { background: #ecfdf5; color: #059669; }
    .badge-lv-중급 { background: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; }
    .badge-lv-고급 { background: #faf5ff; color: #7c3aed; }

    .word-stage { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 14px 6px 18px; }
    .hanzi-big { font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 4.9rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .pinyin-text { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .meaning-box { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 13px 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .meaning-label { font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .meaning-text { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; transition: filter 0.2s, opacity 0.2s; }
    .meaning-text.hidden-meaning { filter: blur(8px); opacity: 0.35; user-select: none; }
    .mini-toggle { border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--blue); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .audio-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; width: 100%; max-width: 380px; }
    @media (max-width: 420px) { .audio-actions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .tts-notice { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); min-height: 18px; text-align: center; }

    /* Hanzi Writer Tianzige */
    .writing-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .writing-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; }
    .char-selector { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .char-chip {
      min-width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #f8fafc;
      font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .char-chip.active { background: var(--primary-soft); border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }
    .tianzi-box {
      width: 270px; height: 270px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto 10px; position: relative;
      background: #fff; border: 2px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; touch-action: none;
    }
    @media (min-width: 420px) { .tianzi-box { width: 290px; height: 290px; } }
    .tianzi-grid-svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
    #hanziTarget { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: grid; place-items: center; }
    .writer-status { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; min-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
    .writer-status.success { color: var(--green); }
    .writer-status.warn { color: var(--amber); }
    .writer-status.info { color: var(--blue); }
    .writer-controls { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Filter Pills & Cards */
    .filter-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .filter-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; }
    .pill-btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--card); color: #475569; padding: 7px 13px;
      border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.83rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .pill-btn.active { background: var(--primary); border-color: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
    .cards-grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .cards-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    .conv-card { padding: 18px; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
    .conv-zh { font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: 1.32rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 8px 0 4px; }
    .conv-pinyin { font-size: 0.94rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .conv-ko { font-size: 0.94rem; color: #334155; font-weight: 600; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .card-audio-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 4px; }

    .culture-card { padding: 20px; gap: 12px; border-top: 4px solid var(--primary); }
    .culture-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; justify-content: space-between; }
    .culture-head-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .culture-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--primary-soft); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .culture-title { margin: 0; font-size: 1.06rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .culture-tag { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
    .culture-desc { margin: 0; font-size: 0.91rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.65; }
    .culture-quote-box { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 13px 14px; margin-top: auto; }
    .culture-quote-label { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .culture-zh { font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: 1.13rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .culture-pinyin { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .culture-ko { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px; }

    /* Quiz */
    .quiz-wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .quiz-settings-card {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .mode-switch { display: inline-flex; background: #e2e8f0; padding: 4px; border-radius: 10px; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .mode-btn { border: none; background: transparent; padding: 7px 11px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .mode-btn.active { background: var(--card); color: var(--text); box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
    .quiz-card { text-align: center; padding: 26px 20px; }
    .quiz-progress-badge { display: inline-block; background: #f1f5f9; color: #334155; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .quiz-question-label { font-size: 0.86rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .quiz-prompt-main { font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.25; }
    .quiz-prompt-ko { font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3.5vw, 1.55rem); font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .quiz-pinyin { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); min-height: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .quiz-helper-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .quiz-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 18px; }
    .quiz-option {
      border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 13px 15px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-align: left; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .quiz-option:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: #94a3b8; background: #f8fafc; }
    .option-num { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .quiz-option.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-soft); color: #14532d; }
    .quiz-option.correct .option-num { background: var(--green); color: #fff; }
    .quiz-option.wrong { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-soft); color: #7f1d1d; }
    .quiz-option.wrong .option-num { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }
    .quiz-option-sub { display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
    .quiz-feedback { border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 16px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.94rem; display: none; }
    .quiz-feedback.show { display: block; }
    .quiz-feedback.is-correct { background: var(--green-soft); color: #15803d; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
    .quiz-feedback.is-wrong { background: var(--red-soft); color: #b91c1c; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }

    /* Quiz Result Summary */
    .result-score-big { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); margin: 8px 0 4px; }
    .result-sub { font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .result-list { text-align: left; max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    .result-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 14px; background: #f8fafc;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
    .result-item.ok { border-left: 4px solid var(--green); }
    .result-item.no { border-left: 4px solid var(--red); background: #fff5f5; }

    .footer-note { margin-top: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .link-btn { border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.8rem; font-family: inherit; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-container">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-badge">汉</div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="brand-title">기초·심화 중국어 마스터</h1>
          <p class="brand-sub">초급·중급·고급 · 단어·회화·획순 쓰기·문화 학습</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-pill" title="단어 학습 화면에서 확인한 단어가 자동 누적됩니다">
        <span id="progressText">학습 1 / 210</span>
        <div class="progress-bar-wrap"><div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progressBar"></div></div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="tabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="learn" role="tab" aria-selected="true">📖 단어·쓰기</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="conv" role="tab" aria-selected="false">💬 실생활 회화</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="culture" role="tab" aria-selected="false">🏮 중국 문화</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="quiz" role="tab" aria-selected="false">🎯 3·5지선다 퀴즈</button>
    </nav>

    <!-- 1. 단어 학습 & Hanzi Writer -->
    <section class="panel active" id="panelLearn">
      <div class="toolbar">
        <div class="toolbar-group">
          <select id="levelSelect" class="select-control" aria-label="난이도 선택">
            <option value="전체">전체 난이도 (210)</option>
            <option value="초급">초급 (120)</option>
            <option value="중급">중급 (45)</option>
            <option value="고급">고급 (45)</option>
          </select>
          <select id="categorySelect" class="select-control" aria-label="주제 선택"></select>
          <select id="wordSelect" class="select-control" aria-label="단어 바로가기"></select>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-buttons">
          <button class="btn" id="prevWordBtn">⬅️ 이전</button>
          <button class="btn" id="randomWordBtn">🎲 랜덤</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="nextWordBtn">다음 ➡️</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="study-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-meta">
            <div style="display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <span class="badge badge-lv-초급" id="wordLevelBadge">초급</span>
              <span class="badge badge-category" id="wordCategoryBadge">인사·표현</span>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-studied" id="wordStudiedBadge">✔ 학습 완료</span>
          </div>
          <div class="word-stage">
            <div class="hanzi-big" id="hanziDisplay">你好</div>
            <div class="pinyin-text" id="pinyinDisplay">nǐ hǎo</div>
            <div class="meaning-box">
              <div class="meaning-label">
                <span>한국어 뜻</span>
                <button class="mini-toggle" id="toggleMeaningBtn">뜻 가리기</button>
              </div>
              <div class="meaning-text" id="meaningDisplay">안녕하세요</div>
            </div>
            <div class="audio-actions">
              <button class="btn btn-blue" id="speakNormalBtn">🔊 발음 듣기</button>
              <button class="btn btn-blue-soft" id="speakSlowBtn">🐢 0.7배속 천천히</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tts-notice" id="ttsNotice"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="writing-header">
            <h2 class="writing-title">✍️ 전(田)자 칸 획순 따라 쓰기</h2>
            <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted);">모르면 '획순 보기' 클릭</span>
          </div>
          <div class="char-selector" id="charSelector"></div>
          <div class="tianzi-box" id="tianziBox">
            <svg class="tianzi-grid-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="50" y1="0" x2="50" y2="100" stroke="#fca5a5" stroke-width="0.9" stroke-dasharray="3,2.5" />
              <line x1="0" y1="50" x2="100" y2="50" stroke="#fca5a5" stroke-width="0.9" stroke-dasharray="3,2.5" />
              <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="100" y2="100" stroke="#fee2e2" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-dasharray="2.5,2.5" />
              <line x1="100" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100" stroke="#fee2e2" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-dasharray="2.5,2.5" />
            </svg>
            <div id="hanziTarget"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="writer-status info" id="writerStatus">획순에 맞춰 바로 써 보세요!</div>
          <div class="writer-controls">
            <button class="btn btn-amber-soft" id="showStrokeAnimBtn">🎬 모르겠어요 (획순 보기)</button>
            <button class="btn" id="clearWriteBtn">🗑️ 지우기</button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. 실생활 회화 -->
    <section class="panel" id="panelConv">
      <div class="filter-bar">
